          <ID>502</ID>
          <Description>"Each slot: Command, Level, XP and the ability melded onto it. Only change Command on a slot you own, then set Level to 1 (0 for moves that have no levels). For items, Level is how many you own - use the battle command unlock script to fill them to 50. If a level ends up too high, tick 'Max level every command' to fix it."</Description>
